# The custom image requires only the Dockerfile and these two build helpers.
# A default-deny context prevents source history, benchmark artifacts, model
# weights, notebook outputs, caches, and credentials from entering an image.
**
!Dockerfile
!docker/
!docker/shortconv-fp8/
!docker/shortconv-fp8/patch_vllm_shortconv_fp8.py
!docker/shortconv-fp8/bake_draft_model.py
